  {
    "location": "body/semantic/29",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Use the email or phone link below to contact the maintainer. With JavaScript enabled, the contact form also offers email-app and webmail drafts. Those draft options do not send a message automatically or submit it to TradeHQ's servers. Response times vary with request volume. For a bug report, include the page URL and reproducible steps so the current build can be checked.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-029",
    "contextText": "Use the email or phone link below to contact the maintainer. With JavaScript enabled, the contact form also offers email-app and webmail drafts. Those draft options do not send a message automatically or submit it to TradeHQ's servers. Response times vary with request volume. For a bug report, include the page URL and reproducible steps so the current build can be checked.",
    "sha256": "050864b2bfce16ab8e6ea8de3f5def4a24485ad6c17887283eedc4b741af12b8"
  },
  {
