  {
    "location": "body/semantic/40",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "My portfolio disappeared — check which account, browser and device you are using. Guest records are browser-held. Account cash, positions and server-recorded trades can be restored when the service is available. Earlier guest trade history and journals stay on the original browser; signed-in lesson and journey progress can sync privately. If sync fails, contact the maintainer before resetting the practice account.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-040",
    "contextText": "My portfolio disappeared — check which account, browser and device you are using. Guest records are browser-held. Account cash, positions and server-recorded trades can be restored when the service is available. Earlier guest trade history and journals stay on the original browser; signed-in lesson and journey progress can sync privately. If sync fails, contact the maintainer before resetting the practice account.",
    "sha256": "196c7ffeb89be25658e09b5b556c5d00a8f434c99e0ab15248eae9b86b812597"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/41",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "How do I reset my practice balance? The portfolio help explains browser-held guest records and account restoration. Clearing site data removes the local copy, including browser-only history and progress, but does not delete or reset the server account copy.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-041",
    "contextText": "How do I reset my practice balance? The portfolio help explains browser-held guest records and account restoration. Clearing site data removes the local copy, including browser-only history and progress, but does not delete or reset the server account copy.",
    "sha256": "09371e4d5fce2d0c399866d4037b173f31dba4d88365f0ce7882bf4e15c688c2"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/42",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "A price looks wrong — quotes refresh periodically, can be stale or use a labelled fixed fallback, and need not match a broker’s executable price.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-042",
    "contextText": "A price looks wrong — quotes refresh periodically, can be stale or use a labelled fixed fallback, and need not match a broker’s executable price.",
    "sha256": "126ec0583913ecbea1bd4818bc638385159e79244edb3bb90f8bcc700fb70d5a"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/43",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Can I use TradeHQ on my phone? Yes, the whole site works on mobile browsers; there is no app to install.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-043",
    "contextText": "Can I use TradeHQ on my phone? Yes, the whole site works on mobile browsers; there is no app to install.",
    "sha256": "85c8909c41a1f99f3cf2aa86775ac98927a91773869db231bb9eaa26b0ba1551"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/44",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Do you have an affiliate or partnership programme? No.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-044",
    "contextText": "Do you have an affiliate or partnership programme? No.",
    "sha256": "604ac1246afed94ba7a0bf5b0e735fbfb335fdb0479ac72e9d2c391d650485ab"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/45",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Reporting a content error",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-045",
    "contextText": "Reporting a content error",
    "sha256": "6c994b4ff16dfb94c68d14d6f710d39bf688e7d053d2c64f81f2e3f8dca8df08"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/46",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Content corrections are the most valuable messages we receive. Send the page URL, quote the sentence you believe is wrong, and where possible link a primary source such as an exchange rule book, a regulator page or a central-bank release. Corrections are applied to the live lesson rather than buried in an errata list.",
    "id": "CONTACT-NOJS-046",
    "contextText": "Content corrections are the most valuable messages we receive. Send the page URL, quote the sentence you believe is wrong, and where possible link a primary source such as an exchange rule book, a regulator page or a central-bank release. Corrections are applied to the live lesson rather than buried in an errata list.",
    "sha256": "99d4916343f1b3f370370be1daea2223c4a9c8f1e6413c86b0d2ecd7fa0d2ad0"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/47",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Response times and expectations",
